    <string name="about_development">Most of this app was built in my spare time, using frontier LLMs to write the code. I am not an Android developer by profession.</string>
    <string name="about_updates">I hope to release app updates within a week of new game content being released.</string>
    <string name="about_feedback">If you find bugs or errors, or would like to suggest improvements, please use the &lt;a href=\"https://github.com/ceav17/HotS-Talent_calculator/issues\"&gt;Issues&lt;/a&gt; section of the GitHub repository, or, if you prefer, email me at &lt;a href=\"mailto:ceav17@keemail.me\"&gt;ceav17@keemail.me&lt;/a&gt;. Before suggesting improvements, please check the &lt;a href=\"https://github.com/ceav17/HotS-Talent_calculator#roadmap\"&gt;roadmap&lt;/a&gt;.</string>
